# Sample requests for the JetBrains HTTP client (GoLand). Synthetic data only.
# Start the app first: make run

@host = http://localhost:8080

### Register SOCIAL_MEDIA task → 202, status READY_TO_SUBMIT. Send again → 200.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111","operation":"SOCIAL_MEDIA","operationVersion":1,"input":{"iin":"000000000000","fullName":"Тестовый клиент"},"documents":[]}

### Same requestId, different input → 409 IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111","operation":"SOCIAL_MEDIA","operationVersion":1,"input":{"iin":"000000000001","fullName":"Тестовый клиент"},"documents":[]}

### Get task → 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tasks/11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111

### Register REGISTER_COMPARE task → 202, status WAITING_DOCUMENTS
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444","operation":"REGISTER_COMPARE","operationVersion":1,"input":{"adjudicate":true},"documents":[{"documentId":"22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222","role":"A","ordinal":1,"attstoreUrl":"https://attstore.example/documents/1","sourceVersion":"3"},{"documentId":"33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333","role":"B","ordinal":1,"attstoreUrl":"https://attstore.example/documents/2","sourceVersion":"1"}]}

### REGISTER_COMPARE with one document → 422 VALIDATION_ERROR, documents INVALID_COUNT
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555555","operation":"REGISTER_COMPARE","operationVersion":1,"input":{},"documents":[{"documentId":"22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222","role":"A","ordinal":1,"attstoreUrl":"https://attstore.example/documents/1","sourceVersion":"3"}]}

### Unknown field → 400 VALIDATION_ERROR, extra UNKNOWN_FIELD
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"66666666-6666-4666-8666-666666666666","operation":"SOCIAL_MEDIA","operationVersion":1,"input":{"iin":"000000000000","fullName":"x"},"documents":[],"extra":1}

### Missing task → 404 TASK_NOT_FOUND
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tasks/99999999-9999-4999-8999-999999999999
